      "value": "@{5a95256f54d514123c1f089d|full_name}: You could simply upload an obj file that is a texture slapped onto a mesh, then upload the avatar with the image, then upload it again, without the image, but leaving the image to the previous version.\nNot efficient but it works.\nI believe you can also modify the image of the previous avatar upload where it is stored in the sdk, which also works.",
