      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yes please! Having to re-upload an avatar just to update a thumbnail is a pain.\n\nPRO TIP:\nIf you copy the VRCCam then place it in your scene it will override the VRCCam created during upload. Place it at 0,0,0 inside an empty game object. Then you can move that game object around and fiddle with the cam settings to your hearts content before uploading.\n\nWhen you upload, just delete the new VRCCam and reset the Transform of your VRCCam. Now you have the perfect thumbnail",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
